OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader brands Black
OL,4,AHistory Month 'racist'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of the Reform-led St Helens
OL,7,FCouncil has said the authority will
OL,8,F"not be observing Black History Month",
OL,9,Fbranding it "racist" and "divisive".
OL,11,FMarked every October in the UK, Black
OL,12,FHistory Month aims to share, celebrate
OL,13,Fand help people understand the impact
OL,14,Fof black heritage and culture.
OL,16,FCouncil Leader George Woodward said if
OL,17,FBritain was "to survive as a country
OL,18,Fthen we can't keep subdividing people
OL,19,Finto groups based on characteristics
OL,20,Flike skin tone, religion and and
OL,21,Fethnicity."
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
