OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader brands Black
OL,4,AHistory Month 'racist'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Bisi Osundeko, who was the first
OL,7,Fblack deputy mayor for St Helens,
OL,8,Fdescribed the comments as "hate speech"
OL,9,Fand said they had "caused a lot of
OL,10,Fhurt" and were "a massive step
OL,11,Fbackwards".
